  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/347553/Spheres-Apocrypha-The-Inheritor-and-Improved-Atavism-Heritages?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: The Inheritor and Improved Atavism Heritages</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sorcerer bloodline class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If a sorcerer bloodline power would create a manufactured weapon, grant a manufactured weapon a special weapon ability (such as frost or shock), or otherwise augment a manufactured weapon, that weapon is treated as a masterwork weapon while under the effects of your bloodline power.</p>\n<p>In addition, while using any sorcerer bloodline power that would grant natural attacks, create a weapon, grant a weapon a special weapon ability, or otherwise augment such a weapon, those weapons gain a +1 enhancement bonus for every 4 effective sorcerer levels you possess (maximum +5).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphere-sorcerer#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
